{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games That Won\u2019t Let You Idle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out with a goofy, lovable sheepdog in this bite-sized desktop mini game collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those little breaks\u2014between tasks, while waiting for a game to download, or just when your brain needs a breather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 mini games right from your desktop\u2014just click and go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it\u2019s time to get back to work, just click on another window and the game auto-pauses for you. Smooth, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Perfect for Micro-Breaks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t sit still? These quick games are made for you. Instant fun, no commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.poster.avif?t=1760434218\" width=480 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.webm?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.mp4?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc15 Your Sidekick Is a Silly Sheepdog</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a bit clumsy, but totally adorable. Join him and his barnyard buddies for some chaotic, heartwarming fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.poster.avif?t=1760434218\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.webm?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.mp4?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Always Ready on Your Desktop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding at the edge of your screen, just hover your mouse and it pops up\u2014ready to play anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Global Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players around the world and feel that cozy mix of casual rivalry and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Built Not to Bother</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It pauses itself when you\u2019re working, and it barely sips your PC\u2019s resources. Super polite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965600?t=1760434218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/32df6d44542935279b02049426aa83f77a1482fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760434218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/8afc95567d55a3203103ff62dbdb7b837e8eb5e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760434218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/8afc95567d55a3203103ff62dbdb7b837e8eb5e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760434218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4026910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games That Won\u2019t Let You Idle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out with a goofy, lovable sheepdog in this bite-sized desktop mini game collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those little breaks\u2014between tasks, while waiting for a game to download, or just when your brain needs a breather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 mini games right from your desktop\u2014just click and go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it\u2019s time to get back to work, just click on another window and the game auto-pauses for you. Smooth, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Perfect for Micro-Breaks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t sit still? These quick games are made for you. Instant fun, no commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.poster.avif?t=1760434218\" width=480 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.webm?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/b1b3395b7e4d66e221d8361f9f026f9f.mp4?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc15 Your Sidekick Is a Silly Sheepdog</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a bit clumsy, but totally adorable. Join him and his barnyard buddies for some chaotic, heartwarming fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.poster.avif?t=1760434218\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.webm?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/85d1822e5e674196c99edd66169b2a43.mp4?t=1760434218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Always Ready on Your Desktop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding at the edge of your screen, just hover your mouse and it pops up\u2014ready to play anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Global Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players around the world and feel that cozy mix of casual rivalry and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Built Not to Bother</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It pauses itself when you\u2019re working, and it barely sips your PC\u2019s resources. Super polite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["tatsumaki games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/29f471c56b1a9390aabb77561cb54ba48c71da66/header.jpg?t=1760434218","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_